{"results": [{"id": "hp_doc_d784333905275a104fc5c02c8d48bc4955b4eaa7cc365a442186dd4ec65d6d76", "title": "Mighty Morphin Power Rangers: The Movie", "text": "Mighty Morphin Power Rangers: The Movie (also known as Power Rangers: The Movie) is a 1995 American superhero film based on the television series \"Mighty Morphin Power Rangers\". It stars the ensemble cast of Karan Ashley, Johnny Yong Bosch, Steve Cardenas, Jason David Frank, Amy Jo Johnson, and David Yost alongside the villains cast from the original series and Paul Freeman as Ivan Ooze. Much like the television season that followed the release, it used concepts from the Japanese Super Sentai series \"Ninja Sentai Kakuranger\". It is the first \"Power Rangers\" production from Saban Entertainment not to feature any archived footage from \"Super Sentai\".", "score": 46.1681}, {"id": "hp_doc_96e5211d7638be437397bed235eaaef4a788387bc9bf965bb8962ae28eb01d67", "title": "Mighty Morphin Power Rangers (comics)", "text": "Mighty Morphin Power Rangers is a comic series spun off from the \"Mighty Morphin Power Rangers\" television show.", "score": 46.0004}, {"id": "hp_doc_cd04f46de57311148ab45f3c929e0753d75587d2d3217165c9bbb4d1b317d004", "title": "Mighty Morphin Alien Rangers", "text": "Mighty Morphin Alien Rangers is a \"Power Rangers\" series set at the end of the third season of \"Mighty Morphin Power Rangers\". As with the rest of the third season of \"Mighty Morphin Power Rangers\", this series adapted footage and costumes from the eighteenth Super Sentai series, \"Ninja Sentai Kakuranger\".", "score": 45.6798}], "remaining_searches": 2}
